`. The unrenamed doc also still carries the old names internally: line 282 (\"The VM is a new `yin.vm.debruijn-vm` namespace\"), and its B3/B4/B5 boxes cite `debruijn_vm.cljc` / `debruijn_vm_test.cljc` paths (lines 389–390, 402–403, 418). Fix before commit: rename the doc, update those five internal spots, or revert the seven citations.\n\n**P2-1 — Stale \"B2 does not exist yet\" claims in the merged kernel.** `debruijn/stack.cljc` ns docstring lines 10–13 and the `eval` ex-info message (lines 249–251: \"B2 (the named-datom lowerer) does not exist yet\") — and `stack_test.cljc` lines 5–7. B2 lands in the same"}]}}
